# Active themes, in rotation order. One line per theme, blank lines and
# # comments ignored.
#
# A theme belongs here ONLY once it has all three parts:
#   design/themes/<name>.css      tokens
#   design/layouts/<name>.css     composition + components
#   design/templates/<name>.html  structure
#
# A theme with only tokens is a recolour of another theme's layout, not a
# design system. scripts/pick-theme.mjs refuses to select one.
#
# Rotation is monthly, not per post: a look needs roughly a dozen posts to
# register. Selection is derived from the calendar month, so there is no
# state to advance and nothing to drift.
#
# ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING, twice over:
#
# 1. Selection is `month_index % count`. September 2026 sits at index 2 under
#    both the old three-theme list and this seven-theme one, so 03-vistto-mono
#    MUST stay third — otherwise adding themes would have changed the look
#    halfway through a month, against decks already published in it.
#
# 2. Neighbours should not look alike. Consecutive entries alternate light and
#    dark grounds and never repeat a display face back to back — Anton carries
#    02 and 04, so 00 sits between them.

01-acid-editorial
06-desk-collage
03-vistto-mono
02-studio-marker
00-bold-editorial
